    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n15275" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμοῖ</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>just, lately,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				615
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				4.51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Lyc.
				106
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Call.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				44
			</span></i>; <i>at once,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.36
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>just, a little,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Steril.</u>
				213
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>tightly,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cord.</u>
				12
			</span></i>.—Written 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμῷ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					10
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Cord.</u>
			</span></i> l.c., cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				144.49
			</span></i>. (Old locative of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμός.</span>)</div>
